    <item>
      <title>Compact Bedroom Interior Design</title>
      <link>https://suman975.com.np/2026/compact-bedroom-interior-design/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://suman975.com.np/2026/compact-bedroom-interior-design/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Designed within a compact 15&amp;rsquo;-5&amp;quot; × 9&amp;rsquo;-2&amp;quot; footprint, this bedroom focuses on maximizing storage while maintaining a warm and uncluttered spatial experience. The layout is driven by a continuous built-in storage wall that integrates wardrobes, overhead cabinets, display niches, and shoe storage into a single cohesive system.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A key feature is the storage-lined passage behind the bed, leading to the attached bathroom. This transitional space doubles as functional storage while maintaining clear circulation. At its end, a full-height backlit mirror creates a subtle dressing area and enhances the sense of depth.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
